    choice IR_AC_PROTOCOL_CHOICE
        prompt "Air conditioner protocol"
        default IR_AC_PROTOCOL_FUJITSU_AC
        help
            IR protocol of the air conditioner (decode_type_t of IRremoteESP8266). Only this protocol is
            compiled, the whole library would not fit into the OTA partition. The IR receiver (later version)
            shows the protocol of an unknown remote.

